{"schemaVersion":1,"framework":"react","version":"v1","id":"builder/overview","title":"Builder overview","description":"Understand the definition editor, its headless React components, and the path from design to a running form.","body":[{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The builder lets people design multi-step forms in your application. It manages\neditable definitions, selection, history, validation schemas, and export while\nyou supply the editor's layout and controls."]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:h2","props":{"id":"follow-the-authoring-workflow"},"children":["Follow the authoring workflow"]},"\n",{"tag":"mdx:pre","props":{"className":"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","style":{"--shiki-light":"#24292e","--shiki-dark":"#e1e4e8","--shiki-light-bg":"#fff","--shiki-dark-bg":"#24292e"},"tabIndex":"0","icon":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M 6,1 C 4.354992,1 3,2.354992 3,4 v 16 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 12 c 1.645008,0 3,-1.354992 3,-3 V 8 7 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 20.707031,6.2929687 l -5,-5 A 1.0001,1.0001 0 0 0 15,1 h -1 z m 0,2 h 7 v 3 c 0,1.645008 1.354992,3 3,3 h 3 v 11 c 0,0.564129 -0.435871,1 -1,1 H 6 C 5.4358712,21 5,20.564129 5,20 V 4 C 5,3.4358712 5.4358712,3 6,3 Z M 15,3.4140625 18.585937,7 H 16 C 15.435871,7 15,6.5641288 15,6 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg>"},"children":[{"tag":"code","props":{},"children":[[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Registry → palette → steps and fields → inspector and schemas"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["                              ↓"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["                       JSON definition"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["                        ↙           ↘"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"line"},"children":[{"tag"